  "vendor_website": "entes.com.tr",
  "description": "MPR-63 network analyser: 16-bit measurement table (0-84, secondary values) and setup registers (256-364). The 32-bit table is in the MPR63 map.",
  "revision": 3,
  "revised": "2026-11-10",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "MPR63 series user manual, chapter 3: Modbus RTU protocol and register maps",
      "date": "2018",
      "url": "https://www.enteselektronik.com/uploads/files/MPR63_Register_Table.pdf",
      "note": "data register maps (3.12, 3.13) and setup register map (3.14)"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "In the 16-bit table voltages must be multiplied by the VT ratio (register 75), currents by the CT ratio (register 74) and powers by both; the 32-bit table in the MPR63 map already includes them.",
    "Values marked writable accept only 0 (clears the min, max, demand or energy value). Setup registers are written with FC06/FC16.",
    "Setup registers are listed for the base MPR63; models with inputs, relays or other options have extra or different setup maps in the manual. Not tested on a device."
  ],
